450
00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.040
Oh, my gosh.

451
00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:20.280
That's such a beautiful detail.

452
00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:25.180
So Stanford has their own version of Jim and Pam that hang out at reception and flirt.

453
00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:25.920
Yeah.

454
00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.040
Amazing, right?

455
00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:28.940
That's amazing.

